  textContent: "If you're reading this, you woke up like I did.\r\nThree modules.
    One timer at a time.\r\n\r\nThe only way to stop one is to fix whatever\r\nthis
    place needs fixed.\r\n\r\nI got through the first. I'm writing this\r\nbefore
    the second.\r\n\r\nDon't waste time looking for a way out \u2014\r\nthere isn't
    one until the last module is off."
